.git
.gitignore
# .streamlit holds the live Groq key on a developer machine. It is in
# .gitignore, so a clean clone never has it, but api.Dockerfile does
# `COPY . .` over the whole build context: building from a working directory
# would bake a real credential into an image the runbook tells you to push to
# a registry. Verified absent from the 2026-09-01 images only because those
# were built from a fresh clone.
.streamlit
.env
.env.*
*.pem
.venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.staging
Database
uploads
extraction_cache
course_brain_db
apps/web/node_modules
apps/web/.next*
apps/web/*.tsbuildinfo
deploy/staging/.env.staging
deploy/staging/cloudflared/config.yml
deploy/staging/cloudflared/*.json
deploy/staging/secrets
